MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_001: You will be OK. I've managed to stop your bleeding.\nNow all you have to do is heal.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_002: Ah! Promised One! What brings you to the\ninfirmary? You aren't wounded, are you?
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_003: I see. That's a relief. Aah! Oh! H-how embarrassing,\ngetting lightheaded in front of the Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_004: I'm sorry. I don't mean to worry you.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_005: I have a history of collapsing, so I have to\nwatch myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_006: To be honest, I think I may have used too much\nenergy providing treatments today.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_007: <NCA>"You're overexerting yourself."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_008: <NCB>"If only I'd protected everyone."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_009: <ACA>Maybe... But even this is not enough. There are\nmany people my treatment cannot reach...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_010: <ACB>No, Promised One. Please, try not to carry that\nweight by yourself. I have a role to fulfill here too...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_011: <ACB>None of the injured blame you... It's just...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_012: Even with my healing, there remain some injuries\nI cannot mend.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_013: Accepting they can no longer serve in battle creates\nwounds in their hearts that can't be reached.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_014: And knowing that there's damage I can't fix only\nreminds me how powerless I am.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_015: <NCA>"I think you've earned a rest, Fianna."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_016: I can't... Even if I COULD rest, my dreams wouldn't\nallow for any peace... 
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_017: Even in my dreams, I'm treating people. One after\nanother, they're all begging for my help...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_018: But I'm always too late to save them... And when I\nfinally look around, I see nothing but corpses.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_019: They stare at me in silence... But it would be so\nmuch easier if they told me they hated me!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_020: That's why...as long as I can move, I can't stop.\nBecause...I don't want...to see...any more death.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_021: *gasp* Did I fall asleep? Oh! I'm so sorry!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_022: Not only did I faint in front of the Promised One, I\nrested my head in their lap!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_023: I have to get back to the injured... Hm?
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_024: We may no longer be able to fight, but we can still\nserve. Allow us to assist you however you need.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_025: I see. These people... I thought I couldn't help them.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_026: I thought I was useless...that all my efforts were\nin vain.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_027: Forgive me if my falling asleep on you caused\nany annoyance.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_028: <NCA>"I enjoyed watching you sleep."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_029: Oh! I-is that so? Well...it WAS quite peaceful...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_A_030: Being so close to you...it's no wonder. Thank you.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_001: Promised One...wherever you are, know that thanks\nto you, Dagda has been saved...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_002: You will be forever in my heart... So please, please\nrest in peace.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_003: <NCA>"Fianna..."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_004: <NCB>"I made it back to you."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_005: *gasp* Could it be...that my prayers were answered?
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_006: I never stopped praying, but to even see this vision\nof you is more than I could have hoped for!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_007: Heh... Your laugh...it almost sounds like the real\nthing. If an illusion of you is all I get, I'll take it...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_008: <NCA>"Touch my hand."
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_009: <NCB>"My laugh? Well, what about my frown?"
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_010: <ACA>I shouldn't... If I touch you, you may disappear...\nWait... Could it be?!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_011: <ACB>Hmhm. Close... Wait. Could it be?!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_012: Y-you're not an illusion! And...I'm not dreaming!\nIs it really you?!
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_013: Oh! I don't know what to say. You...you were the\nlight of my life...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_014: You illuminated my anxious heart and warmed me\nevery time I shivered in the cold...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_015: And then...and then... *sob* Well, I...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_016: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_017: I'm sorry. I don't mean to cry...
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_018: May I ask a favor of you?
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_019: If it's not too much trouble...could I rest my head on\nyour lap one more time?
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_020: <RSDS>You bring me so much peace... Like being\nsurrounded by light.
MID_SE_Ism_Fia_S_021: Right here with you...I feel like you and I have\nbecome one... Thank you...